| Mule Error Type | Python Exception Class |
|---|---|
| `APP:*` | `BusinessError` |
| `VALIDATION:*` | `ValueError` |
| `CONNECTIVITY:*` | `ConnectionError` |
| `TIMEOUT:*` | `TimeoutError` |
| `EXPRESSION:*` | `KeyError` / `TypeError` |
